    text: "Affected northbound trips on D Line:\r\n11:56 am from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station to 18th & California Station\r\n12:11 pm from Littleton / Mineral Ave Station to 18th & California Station\r\n\nAffected northbound trips on E Line:\r\n11:42 am from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n11:57 am from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n\nAffected northbound trips on H Line:\r\n11:57 am from Florida Station to 18th & California Station"
